; refusal-registry-mismatch: two same-shaped targets, each with a keyed ramp,
; so the frames prove the join is actually exercised. The carrier itself is
; canonical; the refusal is the semantic identity of the join, not a decode
; error. Both probe joins below keep the PACT structurally valid.
(transport :bpm 120 :meter [4 4])

(track :target alpha
  (key :at 0b :value 0.1)
  (key :at 4b :value 0.9))

(track :target bravo
  (key :at 0b :value 0.8)
  (key :at 4b :value 0.2))
